  "story": {
    "text": "Mr. Knightley {THANKS} Emma for being kind to Jane, and she glows. Then Miss Bates bursts in, very {CHATTY} and good-humoured, with {TIDINGS}: Mr. Elton is to marry a Miss Hawkins of Bath, with ten {THOUSAND} pounds! He has {CONSOLED} himself in four {WEEKS}. Now Emma must tell poor Harriet.",
